{"id":"056f7b0dff6c7aee","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-deficiency-indices.md","title":"Deficiency Indices","display":"df-deficiency-indices — Deficiency Indices","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-deficiency-indices","aliases":["58-df-deficiency-indices","Deficiency Indices"],"display":"df-deficiency-indices — Deficiency Indices","depends_on":["[[58-df-symmetric-operator]]","[[58-df-hilbert-space]]","[[58-df-vector-space]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-dimension]]","[[58-df-linear-map]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-deficiency-indices"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-deficiency-indices</span><span>Deficiency Indices</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-deficiency-indices — Deficiency Indices"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"10205c9c4c85a35d\" href=\"?note=10205c9c4c85a35d\" title=\"58-df-symmetric-operator\">58-df-symmetric-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"58-df-hilbert-space\">58-df-hilbert-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"58-df-vector-space\">58-df-vector-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"522587a7fec6816a\" href=\"?note=522587a7fec6816a\" title=\"58-df-dimension\">58-df-dimension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"58-df-linear-map\">58-df-linear-map</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,D,D^*,T,T^*,B,+_D,\\odot_D,+_{D^*},\\odot_{D^*},+_H,\\odot_H\\in V\">\\(H,D,D^*,T,T^*,B,+_D,\\odot_D,+_{D^*},\\odot_{D^*},+_H,\\odot_H\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,D^*\\subseteq H\">\\(D,D^*\\subseteq H\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"58-df-hilbert-space\">58-df-hilbert-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SymmetricOperatorStructure}_S(T,D,H,B,\\mathbb C,+_D,\\odot_D,+_H,\\odot_H)\">\\(\\mathrm{SymmetricOperatorStructure}_S(T,D,H,B,\\mathbb C,+_D,\\odot_D,+_H,\\odot_H)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"10205c9c4c85a35d\" href=\"?note=10205c9c4c85a35d\" title=\"58-df-symmetric-operator\">58-df-symmetric-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\)</span> are used with their exact registered signatures</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UnboundedAdjoint}_S(T^*,D^*;T,D,H,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{UnboundedAdjoint}_S(T^*,D^*;T,D,H,B)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DeficiencyIndices}_S(n_+,n_-;T,T^*,D,D^*,H)\">\\(\\mathrm{DeficiencyIndices}_S(n_+,n_-;T,T^*,D,D^*,H)\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deficiency\\text{-}indices\\text{-}adjoint}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UnboundedAdjoint}_S(T^*,D^*;T,D,H,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(T,D,H)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T^*,D^*,H)\\land D,D^*\\subseteq H\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall y\\in H\\;\\left(y\\in D^*\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists z\\in H\\;\\forall x\\in D\\;B(\\langle T(x),y\\rangle)=B(\\langle x,z\\rangle)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall y\\in D^*\\;\\forall z\\in H\\;\\left(\n\\forall x\\in D\\;B(\\langle T(x),y\\rangle)=B(\\langle x,z\\rangle)\n\\to T^*(y)=z\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deficiency\\text{-}indices\\text{-}adjoint}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UnboundedAdjoint}_S(T^*,D^*;T,D,H,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(T,D,H)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T^*,D^*,H)\\land D,D^*\\subseteq H\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall y\\in H\\;\\left(y\\in D^*\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists z\\in H\\;\\forall x\\in D\\;B(\\langle T(x),y\\rangle)=B(\\langle x,z\\rangle)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall y\\in D^*\\;\\forall z\\in H\\;\\left(\n\\forall x\\in D\\;B(\\langle T(x),y\\rangle)=B(\\langle x,z\\rangle)\n\\to T^*(y)=z\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deficiency\\text{-}indices}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DeficiencyIndices}_S(n_+,n_-;T,T^*,D,D^*,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists B,+_D,\\odot_D,+_{D^*},\\odot_{D^*},+_H,\\odot_H,\n+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C},0_H,\nN_+,N_-,+_+,\\odot_+,+_-,\\odot_-\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(H,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{SymmetricOperatorStructure}_S(T,D,H,B,\\mathbb C,+_D,\\odot_D,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T^*,D^*,H,\\mathbb C,+_{D^*},\\odot_{D^*},+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{UnboundedAdjoint}_S(T^*,D^*;T,D,H,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land N_+=\\{y\\in D^*:T^*(y)=\\odot_H(\\langle i,y\\rangle)\\}\n\\land N_-=\\{y\\in D^*:T^*(y)=\\odot_H(\\langle-i,y\\rangle)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(N_+,\\mathbb C,+_+,\\odot_+,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(N_-,\\mathbb C,+_-,\\odot_-,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land0_H\\in N_+\\cap N_-\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall u,v\\in N_+\\;\\bigl(+_+(\\langle u,v\\rangle)=+_H(\\langle u,v\\rangle)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall u\\in N_+\\;\\bigl(\\odot_+(\\langle a,u\\rangle)=\\odot_H(\\langle a,u\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall u,v\\in N_-\\;\\bigl(+_-(\\langle u,v\\rangle)=+_H(\\langle u,v\\rangle)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall u\\in N_-\\;\\bigl(\\odot_-(\\langle a,u\\rangle)=\\odot_H(\\langle a,u\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\!\\left(n_+,\\langle N_+,\\mathbb C,+_+,\\odot_+,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C},0_H\\rangle\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\!\\left(n_-,\\langle N_-,\\mathbb C,+_-,\\odot_-,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C},0_H\\rangle\\right)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deficiency\\text{-}indices}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DeficiencyIndices}_S(n_+,n_-;T,T^*,D,D^*,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists B,+_D,\\odot_D,+_{D^*},\\odot_{D^*},+_H,\\odot_H,\n+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C},0_H,\nN_+,N_-,+_+,\\odot_+,+_-,\\odot_-\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(H,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{SymmetricOperatorStructure}_S(T,D,H,B,\\mathbb C,+_D,\\odot_D,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T^*,D^*,H,\\mathbb C,+_{D^*},\\odot_{D^*},+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{UnboundedAdjoint}_S(T^*,D^*;T,D,H,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land N_+=\\{y\\in D^*:T^*(y)=\\odot_H(\\langle i,y\\rangle)\\}\n\\land N_-=\\{y\\in D^*:T^*(y)=\\odot_H(\\langle-i,y\\rangle)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(N_+,\\mathbb C,+_+,\\odot_+,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(N_-,\\mathbb C,+_-,\\odot_-,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land0_H\\in N_+\\cap N_-\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall u,v\\in N_+\\;\\bigl(+_+(\\langle u,v\\rangle)=+_H(\\langle u,v\\rangle)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall u\\in N_+\\;\\bigl(\\odot_+(\\langle a,u\\rangle)=\\odot_H(\\langle a,u\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall u,v\\in N_-\\;\\bigl(+_-(\\langle u,v\\rangle)=+_H(\\langle u,v\\rangle)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall u\\in N_-\\;\\bigl(\\odot_-(\\langle a,u\\rangle)=\\odot_H(\\langle a,u\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\!\\left(n_+,\\langle N_+,\\mathbb C,+_+,\\odot_+,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C},0_H\\rangle\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\!\\left(n_-,\\langle N_-,\\mathbb C,+_-,\\odot_-,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C},0_H\\rangle\\right)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Deficiency indices are dimensions of the two explicitly structured eigenspaces of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^*\">\\(T^*\\)</span> at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-i\">\\(-i\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The compatibility predicate keeps its legacy seven data arguments for downstream use, but it now projects from exact Hilbert, symmetric-operator, linear-map, and two-place dimension signatures.</li>\n<li>Weyl: classification of Sturm-Liouville operators by limit circle vs point</li>\n<li>von Neumann: symmetric operator extensions via unitary maps between deficiency spaces</li>\n<li>Cayley transform: unitary maps link self-adjoint operators to unitaries</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Reed and Simon, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Titchmarsh, Eigenfunction Expansions</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-symmetric-operator","status":"resolved","id":"10205c9c4c85a35d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-symmetric-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hilbert-space","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-hilbert-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-vector-space","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-vector-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-dimension","status":"resolved","id":"522587a7fec6816a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-dimension]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-linear-map","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-linear-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hilbert-space","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)$ (see [[58-df-hilbert-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-symmetric-operator","status":"resolved","id":"10205c9c4c85a35d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SymmetricOperatorStructure}_S(T,D,H,B,\\mathbb C,+_D,\\odot_D,+_H,\\odot_H)$ (see [[58-df-symmetric-operator]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H,D,D^*,T,T^*,B,+_D,\\odot_D,+_{D^*},\\odot_{D^*},+_H,\\odot_H\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"D,D^*\\subseteq H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SymmetricOperatorStructure}_S(T,D,H,B,\\mathbb C,+_D,\\odot_D,+_H,\\odot_H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dimension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UnboundedAdjoint}_S(T^*,D^*;T,D,H,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DeficiencyIndices}_S(n_+,n_-;T,T^*,D,D^*,H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deficiency\\text{-}indices\\text{-}adjoint}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UnboundedAdjoint}_S(T^*,D^*;T,D,H,B)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(T,D,H)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T^*,D^*,H)\\land D,D^*\\subseteq H\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall y\\in H\\;\\left(y\\in D^*\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists z\\in H\\;\\forall x\\in D\\;B(\\langle T(x),y\\rangle)=B(\\langle x,z\\rangle)\\right)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall y\\in D^*\\;\\forall z\\in H\\;\\left(\n\\forall x\\in D\\;B(\\langle T(x),y\\rangle)=B(\\langle x,z\\rangle)\n\\to T^*(y)=z\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deficiency\\text{-}indices}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DeficiencyIndices}_S(n_+,n_-;T,T^*,D,D^*,H)\\\\\n&\\leftrightarrow\\exists B,+_D,\\odot_D,+_{D^*},\\odot_{D^*},+_H,\\odot_H,\n+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C},0_H,\nN_+,N_-,+_+,\\odot_+,+_-,\\odot_-\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&\\quad\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(H,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C})\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{SymmetricOperatorStructure}_S(T,D,H,B,\\mathbb C,+_D,\\odot_D,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T^*,D^*,H,\\mathbb C,+_{D^*},\\odot_{D^*},+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{UnboundedAdjoint}_S(T^*,D^*;T,D,H,B)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land N_+=\\{y\\in D^*:T^*(y)=\\odot_H(\\langle i,y\\rangle)\\}\n\\land N_-=\\{y\\in D^*:T^*(y)=\\odot_H(\\langle-i,y\\rangle)\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(N_+,\\mathbb C,+_+,\\odot_+,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C})\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(N_-,\\mathbb C,+_-,\\odot_-,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C})\\\\\n&\\quad\\land0_H\\in N_+\\cap N_-\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall u,v\\in N_+\\;\\bigl(+_+(\\langle u,v\\rangle)=+_H(\\langle u,v\\rangle)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall u\\in N_+\\;\\bigl(\\odot_+(\\langle a,u\\rangle)=\\odot_H(\\langle a,u\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall u,v\\in N_-\\;\\bigl(+_-(\\langle u,v\\rangle)=+_H(\\langle u,v\\rangle)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall u\\in N_-\\;\\bigl(\\odot_-(\\langle a,u\\rangle)=\\odot_H(\\langle a,u\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\!\\left(n_+,\\langle N_+,\\mathbb C,+_+,\\odot_+,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C},0_H\\rangle\\right)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\!\\left(n_-,\\langle N_-,\\mathbb C,+_-,\\odot_-,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C},0_H\\rangle\\right)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T^*","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"-i","display":false}],"bytes":4106,"backlinks":[{"id":"2d25e8ce649f1baf","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-400","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-deficiency-indices.md|58-df-deficiency-indices]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["10205c9c4c85a35d","b70ce791d5b1a19b","592f9cfb66a507c2","36d7463d215be751","522587a7fec6816a","f67456d74b418241"]}